    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "From that incomplete recipe, the predecessor deduced that refined wealth Gu can turn into anything in the world, from gold and silver to rank six through rank nine immortal material, but not into living beings such as animals, plants, humans, variant humans, or Gu. Shi Zhong hopes to convert it into extinct Gu materials for profit and cultivation foundation.",
        "chapters": [
          1474
        ],
