  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Shi Zhong of Western Desert’s Shi clan fails again and again at refining wealth Gu from an incomplete Immortal Gu recipe he treats as treasure. The legend writes it from blue sea water, Ren Zu’s hands, worry Gu, difficulty Gu, sadness Gu, wisdom Gu, and stupidity Gu, materials that cannot be followed literally in the present world.",
        "chapters": [
          1474
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shi_zhong",
          "reg_western_desert",
          "fac_shi_clan",
          "sys_gu_recipe",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "gu_worry_gu",
          "gu_wisdom_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Legends of Ren Zu state that Ren Zu spent enormous effort and sacrificed his own two hands to refine wealth Gu. Fate Gu later binds that wealth Gu with spider silk, takes it away, and says Ren Zu has no fate to enjoy it even after refining it.",
        "chapters": [
          1619
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ren-zu-legend",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "gu_fate_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By the time of the freedom Gu legend, fate Gu has already parted Ren Zu from his children and stripped him of wealth Gu as well, leaving him mad with the double loss.",
        "chapters": [
          1954
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
